Subject: [PATCH] MiuiCamera: suppress stock-only permission warning

The camera APK includes a "permission_error" toast that tells users to
contact R&D when a permission check fails. This message belongs to the
vendor permission flow and is not useful on the AOSP port; Android's own
runtime permission UI remains unchanged.
---
diff --git a/smali/com/android/camera/ActivityBase$c.smali b/smali/com/android/camera/ActivityBase$c.smali
--- a/smali/com/android/camera/ActivityBase$c.smali
+++ b/smali/com/android/camera/ActivityBase$c.smali
@@ -78,11 +78,7 @@
     :pswitch_0
     goto/16 :goto_1
 
     :pswitch_1
-    const p1, 0x7f140af8
-
-    invoke-static {p0, p1, v6}, LA/g4;->c(Landroid/content/Context;IZ)V
-
     goto/16 :goto_1
 
     :pswitch_2
